              "type": "text",
              "text": "<p>On <strong><strong>Friday 25th September 2026,</strong></strong><strong><strong> </strong></strong>the doors of the <strong><strong>Lumiere Cinema</strong></strong> open at 6:00pm to cinema’s most secret gathering. For one night only, step into a world of mystery and cinematic magic—where the films remain hidden until the moment they appear on screen. Each year this exclusive event sells out, leaving only those inside to share its secrets.<br>Will you be among them?<br>What gems will you discover?</p>",
